{"title":"Claims about police shootings","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/918489491/0/marginalrevolution~Claims-about-police-shootings.html","date":1747507934000,"content":"<p>There is a new book by Tom S. Clark, Adam N. Glynn, and Michael Leo Owens, called <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Deadly-Force-Police-Shootings-America/dp/0691260788/ref=sr_1_1?crid=WAMBPYDSG8KZ&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.LiFEBS3-KRVMhu0H5nzmUyAcE1Ivpoa2gdyp3vq_NZ-eCt2xVVJJDvmhdKKT1VaO5-lYlDzThhJq3XGmEiSS9nlRFNHrNjH3lrTNG9ax78NqkrboaCnGu8x61r0nAjjq2oatCAtobYYqL1Bg9JdYyl5tvjlL3LIOFHblxhE_iKVbMRMbpp_5Ce5bWByLY0_k.F4HyYGLOlVpWO0uIzBmrTVd8ZCSm8dvpH3x7tX27QCI&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=deadly+force+police+shootings+in+urban+america&amp;qid=1747399484&amp;sprefix=deadly+force%2Caps%2C90&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Deadly Force: Police Shootings in Urban America</a>.  Here are a few of the conclusions:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>…we were more likely to obtain records [on police shootings] from cities with women mayors and more women on municipal legislatures.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And, most interesting to me:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>…we also found that fewer police shootings occurred in cities with more police, all else equal.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>…Black and Hispanic officers are disproportionately the ones involved in police shootings.  That is particularly true when a Black civilian is the subject of the shooting.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>I do not follow this area closely, but the book seems of interest.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html\">Claims about police shootings</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/918489491/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/918489491/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/918489491/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/918489491/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/918489491/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/918489491/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html#comment-160915900\">In reply to Pardon the word play.   I get paid more than $120 ...</a> <i>by Justine Hewitt</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html#comment-160915886\">In reply to Randall.   𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐫𝐭 ...</a> <i>by Justine Hewitt</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/claims-about-police-shootings.html#comment-160915545\">In reply to Neurotic.   Sailer has not noticed that.</a> <i>by Pardon the word play</i></li><li><a href=\"https:/